{"id":"3e8ad15153e3cb59","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity.md","title":"优先级文法消除表达式歧义","display":"thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity — 优先级文法消除表达式歧义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity","aliases":["73-thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity"],"display":"thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity — 优先级文法消除表达式歧义","depends_on":["[[73-df-expression-grammar-precedence]]","[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.4.1–5.4.2, print pp. 207–212; PDF pp. 229–234; local proof for the token abstraction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity — 优先级文法消除表达式歧义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"32edbcb806014788\" href=\"?note=32edbcb806014788\" title=\"73-df-expression-grammar-precedence\">73-df-expression-grammar-precedence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.4.1–5.4.2, print pp. 207–212; PDF pp. 229–234; local proof for the token abstraction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_a,G_u,\\Sigma\">\\(G_a,G_u,\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32edbcb806014788\" href=\"?note=32edbcb806014788\" title=\"73-df-expression-grammar-precedence\">73-df-expression-grammar-precedence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\langle\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt i\\rangle\">\\(w=\\langle\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt i\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(G_a)=L(G_u)\\land\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G_a,w)\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G_u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(G_a)=L(G_u)\\land\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G_a,w)\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G_u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文法可把 w 的根选成加号或乘号，给出不同结构。优先级文法从括号层次为零的最右加号唯一分割 E；不存在这样的加号时转到 T，再按最右乘号分割；最后 F 只可能是 i 或一对包住整个表达式的括号。对词长递归得到唯一分解，也给出每个原始合法表达式的优先级解析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-expression-grammar-precedence","status":"resolved","id":"32edbcb806014788","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-expression-grammar-precedence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-expression-grammar-precedence","status":"resolved","id":"32edbcb806014788","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_a,G_u,\\Sigma$ 见 [[73-df-expression-grammar-precedence]]；$w=\\langle\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt i\\rangle$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G_a,G_u,\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"w=\\langle\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{+},\\mathtt i,\\mathtt{*},\\mathtt i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"L(G_a)=L(G_u)\\land\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G_a,w)\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G_u).","display":true}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-expression-grammar-unambiguity|优先级文法消除表达式歧义]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["32edbcb806014788","a3d61b5dd7be385b"]}